<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Student Testimonials | Mechanical Engineering</title>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

  <!-- Common CSS -->
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">

  <!-- Testimonials CSS -->
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #f4f6f9;
    }

    .page-header {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e3c72, #2a5298);
      color: #fff;
      padding: 40px 20px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .page-header h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 32px;
    }

    .testimonials-container {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 40px auto;
      padding: 0 20px;
    }

    .testimonial-card {
      background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 24px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
      position: relative;
    }

    .testimonial-card::before {
      content: "“";
      font-size: 60px;
      color: #2a5298;
      position: absolute;
      top: 10px;
      left: 20px;
      opacity: 0.15;
    }

    .testimonial-text {
      font-size: 15.5px;
      line-height: 1.7;
      color: #333;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
      padding-left: 10px;
    }

    .student-info {
      border-top: 1px solid #eee;
      padding-top: 12px;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .student-info b {
      font-size: 15px;
      color: #1e3c72;
    }

    .student-info span {
      display: block;
      color: #555;
      margin-top: 2px;
    }

    /* Responsive */
    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .page-header h1 {
        font-size: 24px;
      }
      .testimonial-text {
        font-size: 14.5px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <!-- Header -->
  <div class="page-header">
    <h1>Student Testimonials</h1>
    <p>Department of Mechanical Engineering – Placement Success Stories</p>
  </div>

  <!-- Testimonials -->
  <div class="testimonials-container">

    <div class="testimonial-card">
      <p class="testimonial-text">
        Consistent guidance and support from the faculty of the Department of Mechanical Engineering,
        along with their motivation and structured placement training, enabled me to successfully
        secure my placement.
      </p>
      <div class="student-info">
        <b>Pratul V. S.</b>
        <span>Placed at Hyundai</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="testimonial-card">
      <p class="testimonial-text">
        I sincerely thank the Department of Mechanical Engineering for its excellent facilities,
        hands-on training, and continuous support. The Semester in Industry Program at Sundaram
        Fasteners provided valuable industrial exposure that helped me secure my placement at
        Brakes India Private Limited.
      </p>
      <div class="student-info">
        <b>Sanjay R</b>
        <span>Placed at Brakes India Private Limited</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="testimonial-card">
      <p class="testimonial-text">
        The hands-on training and industry-oriented approach of the Mechanical Engineering
        department played a key role in my placement success.
      </p>
      <div class="student-info">
        <b>Anandha Ram S</b>
        <span>Placed at Brakes India Private Limited</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="testimonial-card">
      <p class="testimonial-text">
        A strong foundation in core mechanical subjects, along with continuous guidance from faculty
        advisors and the placement coordinator, played a crucial role in my placement at SPIC.
        The structured training and constant encouragement from the Placement Cell and Department
        helped me approach the process with confidence.
      </p>
      <div class="student-info">
        <b>Adithya S</b>
        <span>Placed at SPIC</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="testimonial-card">
      <p class="testimonial-text">
        The communication skills course in the sixth-semester curriculum, along with the core
        knowledge imparted by the department faculty, was instrumental in thoroughly preparing me
        for the placement process, enhancing both my confidence and performance.
      </p>
      <div class="student-info">
        <b>Viswanathan G</b>
        <span>Placed at INOX Air Products Pvt. Ltd.</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="testimonial-card">
      <p class="testimonial-text">
        I am grateful to the Department of Mechanical Engineering for providing a strong foundation
        in core subjects and excellent training opportunities. The communication and aptitude
        training, along with continuous guidance from the faculty and placement coordinator,
        played a vital role in preparing me for the placement process. This support and structured
        learning helped me confidently secure my placement at Mu Sigma.
      </p>
      <div class="student-info">
        <b>Aravind K</b>
        <span>Placed at Mu Sigma</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="testimonial-card">
      <p class="testimonial-text">
        I am grateful to the Mechanical Engineering Department for their guidance, practical training,
        and continuous support. The knowledge and industry-oriented preparation provided by the
        department helped me secure my placement at Jones Lang LaSalle Incorporated.
      </p>
      <div class="student-info">
        <b>Sri Varthini V M</b>
        <span>Placed at Jones Lang LaSalle Incorporated</span>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

  <!-- Footer (reuse existing footer) -->
</body>
</html>
